{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <initial><transition target=\"a1\"/></initial>\n    <initial><transition target=\"a2\"/></initial>\n    <onentry>\n      <send event=\"report\">\n        <content>first</content>\n        <content>second</content>\n      </send>\n    </onentry>\n    <invoke type=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/\">\n      <content expr=\"'child.scxml'\"/>\n      <content expr=\"'other.scxml'\"/>\n      <finalize><log expr=\"'one'\"/></finalize>\n      <finalize><log expr=\"'two'\"/></finalize>\n    </invoke>\n    <state id=\"a1\"><transition event=\"go\" target=\"done\"/></state>\n    <state id=\"a2\"><transition event=\"go\" target=\"done\"/></state>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":4,"notes":0,"total":5,"warnings":1},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":49,"byteOffset":162,"endColumn":49,"endLine":4,"startColumn":49,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove the second `<initial>`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":13,"endLine":4,"startColumn":6,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<state>` has 2 `<initial>` children, but allows at most one\n\n**Note:** a `<state>` has at most one `<initial>`: it is the one default entry transition of the state\n\n**Help:** keep one `<initial>`; to enter several parallel descendants, list them all as targets of its one `<transition>`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.3 <state>","text":"`<state>` has 2 `<initial>` children, but allows at most one"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":175,"start":168},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"first `<initial>`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":13,"endLine":3,"startColumn":6,"startLine":3}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML064"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":34,"byteOffset":286,"endColumn":34,"endLine":8,"startColumn":33,"startLine":7},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove the second `<content>`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":17,"endLine":8,"startColumn":10,"startLine":8}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<send>` has 2 `<content>` children, but allows at most one\n\n**Note:** `<send>` carries at most one `<content>`: it is the whole event payload, so a second one has no meaning\n\n**Help:** keep the one `<content>` that is the payload; to send several values, use `<param>` children or one structured `<content>`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §6.2 <send>","text":"`<send>` has 2 `<content>` children, but allows at most one"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":303,"start":296},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"first `<content>`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":17,"endLine":7,"startColumn":10,"startLine":7}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML064"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":38,"byteOffset":435,"endColumn":38,"endLine":13,"startColumn":38,"startLine":12},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove the second `<content>`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":15,"endLine":13,"startColumn":8,"startLine":13}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<invoke>` has 2 `<content>` children, but allows at most one\n\n**Note:** `<invoke>` takes at most one inline `<content>`: it is the one document the invoked service runs\n\n**Help:** keep the one `<content>` that is the service's document\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §6.4 <invoke>","text":"`<invoke>` has 2 `<content>` children, but allows at most one"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":450,"start":443},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"first `<content>`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":15,"endLine":12,"startColumn":8,"startLine":12}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML064"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":47,"byteOffset":520,"endColumn":47,"endLine":15,"startColumn":47,"startLine":14},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove the second `<finalize>`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":16,"endLine":15,"startColumn":8,"startLine":15}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<invoke>` has 2 `<finalize>` children, but allows at most one\n\n**Note:** `<invoke>` takes at most one `<finalize>`: it is the one block that processes each event the invoked service returns\n\n**Help:** merge the executable content into one `<finalize>`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §6.4 <invoke>","text":"`<invoke>` has 2 `<finalize>` children, but allows at most one"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":536,"start":528},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"first `<finalize>`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":16,"endLine":14,"startColumn":8,"startLine":14}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML064"},{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":18,"endLine":18,"startColumn":16,"startLine":18}}}],"message":{"markdown":"state `a2` can never become active\n\n**Note:** reachability assumes every event can arrive and every `cond` can be true; no reachable transition, `initial`, or history default enters this state or any of its descendants\n\n**Help:** target `a2` from a transition of a reachable state, make it the initial state of `a`, or remove it\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.11 Legal State Configurations and Specifications\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.13 Selecting and Executing Transitions","text":"state `a2` can never become active"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":665,"start":663},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"`a` enters its `<initial>` target by default"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":13,"endLine":3,"startColumn":6,"startLine":3}}},{"id":2,"message":{"text":"targeted here, but `a` ignores this `<initial>`, so it never runs"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml064-repeated-children.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":36,"endLine":4,"startColumn":34,"startLine":4}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML029"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"no transition, `initial`, or history default reachable from the initial configuration enters the state or any descendant, even assuming every event arrives and every `cond` can be true; unreachable states are usually a mistyped target or a forgotten transition"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: target the state from a transition of a reachable state, make it the parent's initial state, or remove it.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.11 Legal State Configurations and Specifications\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML029` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#LegalStateConfigurations","id":"SCXML029","name":"SCXML029","properties":{"category":"lint"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a state can never become active"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"`<send>` and `<invoke>` carry at most one `<content>` (the payload or the service's document), `<invoke>` at most one `<finalize>`, and `<state>` at most one `<initial>` (SCXML 1.0 §6.2, §6.4, §3.3); the schema allows the repeat, but a second one has no meaning and the compiler rejects it"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: keep one of the repeated children: merge a second `<finalize>` into the first, send several values as `<param>` children, or list several initial targets in one `<initial>` transition.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §6.2 <send>\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML064` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#send","id":"SCXML064","name":"SCXML064","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a `<send>`, `<invoke>`, or `<state>` repeats a child it allows once"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}